<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50631" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰο-χέαιρα</span></b> , ἡ,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰός</span> A) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>arrow-pourer, shooter of arrows</i>, epith. of
			Artemis, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.53
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. παρθένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					2.9
				</span></i>
			: as Subst., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰοχέαιρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					21.480
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.198
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Schwyzer</u>
				758
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.1389i53
			</span></i>; later 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. φαρέτρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.9
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Mnasalc.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰός</span> B) <i>poison-shedding</i>, of
			serpents, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				33
			</span></i>. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-χέϝαιρα</span> from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χέω</span>, not as expld. by Apollon.Lex. etc.
			from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαίρω.</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">
				[ῑ</span> as in <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰός</span>: yet
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ</span> in Pi.l.c.]</div>
